      <p source="#source-535-654"><seg source="#source-535-654">今日ハ金子御入用と存候得バ、小曽根英四郎みせ番頭清吉を以て、六百両さし出申候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-654-836"><seg source="#source-654-735">残弐百両ハ竹行の為ニ今シバらく借用仕置候間、其御心積奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-735-747">レ</note><seg source="#source-747-759">願候。早</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-759-792">〻</g><seg source="#source-792-798">頓首</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-798-831">〻</g><seg source="#source-831-836">。</seg></p>
